      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm also trying to figure out how to address the more practical side of things. like, when people talk about \"infrastructure strain,\" is there any real data to back that up, or is it mostly just people being worried about things like parking and traffic? i want to know if these are legit issues or if they're just common excuses to block new housing.",
